abstract: "Real-time 3D solar and lunar eclipse simulator that renders the umbra and penumbra as physical cones over a WGS84 Earth, built with Unreal Engine 5, Cesium for Unreal and a Python/Skyfield backend using JPL DE441 ephemerides."
keywords:
  - solar eclipse
  - Unreal Engine
  - Cesium
  - Skyfield
  - astronomy
